# ?Ä?Ä?Ä Temporary PG Review UI Flags ?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä?Ä
# Set to "true" right before PG/card review or normal release to show user-facing
# grades, reports, rankings, wrong-answer review, and exam-result screens again.
